              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner (Jeffrey K. Haynes), according to Petitioner (Jeffrey K. Haynes), petitioner argues that Section\u202f2501 does not limit subject\u2011matter jurisdiction and should be applied to the government as an ordinary, waivable affirmative defense."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Haynes",
          "citations": [
